      "description": "pv_eval_rmse_ratio from the daily solar-evaluate job (03:00 UTC): live RMSE on the 500 most recent rows divided by the champion's test RMSE. Retrain is flagged above 1.15 (EVAL_DRIFT_THRESHOLD). With no champion baseline the job uses an absolute live-RMSE limit of 0.15 instead and this ratio is not reported.",
